# Binary assets that must never have their line endings rewritten.
#
# The face-recognition weights are 6.4 MB of float32. Git detected them as binary on this checkout
# and left them alone — verified byte-for-byte against the working tree after committing — but that
# detection is heuristic and a future file could be misread. A weights file with CRLF substituted
# through it does not fail loudly: it loads, produces different descriptors, and every enrolled face
# quietly stops matching. That failure looks exactly like the employees being wrong, which is the
# most expensive kind of bug this product could have in its identity path.
#
# So it is declared rather than inferred.
*.bin binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.safetensors binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
